{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation","id":993039,"title":"Social Engineering, or: Your favourite Tales of Deceit and Manipulation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-25T12:29:34-07:00","id":993039,"title":"Social Engineering, or: Your favourite Tales of Deceit and Manipulation","content":"So, having played a bit I realized that I have little to none ideas on how to play a primarily social character. Physical or mental stats and merits, I get; it does not take much creativity to figure out how to apply Strength and Athletics when trying to bar doors or what you have to do to pick them. Neither do I have much trouble with mental activities.<br /> I do, however, feel a bit lost when figuring out how to use social stuff. My banker wants to apply his Allies (Bank) 4 to freeze some accounts. Easy enough. But how does he go about it?<br /> <br /> So, my train of thought was: &quot;Well yeah, you see characters swing swords in movies, games and books left and right, so of course you know how play that. You are also familiar with people using their smarts to figure out problems from the very same media. But talking people into doing things, tricking your opponent into feeling safe, plotting and executing the downfall of your rival through guile isn't that common. ...right?&quot; Aside from dugging stuff up myself, I wanted to get your recommendations.<br /> <br /> So yeah,<u> long story short,</u> I'd like to hear your favourite inspiration for social engineering, manipulation, tricking the masses, guile etc. Books, movies, series, games, any media is fair game.<br /> Don't shy away from bragging how your Vampire reporter destroyed the Broods mortal power base through blogging, how your Beast politician turned into a small-town-dictator and how your Sin-Eater emberassed the local mayor! Your exploits and how you went about are just as good to me! =)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T12:48:38-07:00","id":993049,"title":"","content":"I'm a social historian of early America, so my real life work infects my gaming. Check out &quot;The 4400&quot; and &quot;Black Mirror&quot;. My two favorite shows of all time, and I think they'll help in different ways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T15:32:47-07:00","id":993127,"title":"","content":"For me, getting into doing social engineering in RPGs came from listening to the recorded games of the podcast RPPR. One of the regular players Caleb is ridiculously good at it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T16:02:13-07:00","id":993152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation#post993039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, having played a bit I realized that I have little to none ideas on how to play a primarily social character. Physical or mental stats and merits, I get; it does not take much creativity to figure out how to apply Strength and Athletics when trying to bar doors or what you have to do to pick them. Neither do I have much trouble with mental activities.<br /> I do, however, feel a bit lost when figuring out how to use social stuff. My banker wants to apply his Allies (Bank) 4 to freeze some accounts. Easy enough. But how does he go about it?</div> </div> </div> </div>He convinces his allies to put in the word among actual authorities (such as the FBI) to supposed illegal activities (such as drug trafficking) being carried on by your target. That's how I'd do it. The convincing would be the allies roll. And the assets would remain frozen whilst an investigation is carried out.<br /> <br /> Keep tossing me hypotheticals and I'll give you further examples.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12191,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","user":"Malus","date":". 10-25-2016, 07:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T16:59:32-07:00","id":993178,"title":"","content":"The show Leverage is exactly what you want, any given episode is probably 80% Social Engineering.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T05:14:20-07:00","id":993438,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar178_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"178\" data-vbnamecard=\"178\">Michael</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1329_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1329\" data-vbnamecard=\"1329\">ElvesofZion</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3093_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3093\" data-vbnamecard=\"3093\">hm8453a</a> thanks! I actually haven't heard about most of these and will be sure to check them out! (Especially RPPR)<br /> <br /> @Malus<br /> Thank you, I'd like to take you up on the offer immediately :-)<br /> 1) how would the Banker scenario be different if it was Status 4 rather than Allies? <br /> 2) a vampire Ventrue cop with dominate wants to put dirt on a colleague or even superior. How would he go about it?<br /> 3) how would a Fairest in the same situation pull that off?<br /> 4) a guy needs To raise A Lot of money quickly. What can he pull to do so?<br /> 5) an (Ugallu tyrant ) Corporate Manager wants to Engineer a Hostile takeover. He has Access to Allies (Media) 2 and (City Hall) 3. What can he do?<br /> Thanks in advance, it is appreciated!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T07:59:46-07:00","id":993494,"title":"","content":"Honestly, when I feel that I need to do some social engineering I'll try and get a copy of The Prince. Helps me get into character a bit, especially if I'm playing vampire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T09:31:33-07:00","id":993534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993438#post993438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Malus<br /> Thank you, I'd like to take you up on the offer immediately :-)<br /> 1) how would the Banker scenario be different if it was Status 4 rather than Allies?</div> </div> </div> </div>You cut down the middleman and forge the false evidence yourself before calling the authorities.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993438#post993438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2) a vampire Ventrue cop with dominate wants to put dirt on a colleague or even superior. How would he go about it?</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't need to set dirt on anything: you dominate the dude into bullying hookers and getting sex in exchange of a free pass while your retainer films or takes pictures of it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993438#post993438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3) how would a Fairest in the same situation pull that off?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not familiar with changeling. Get your mirrorskin pal to put on the show instead?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993438#post993438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4) a guy needs To raise A Lot of money quickly. What can he pull to do so?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ponzi scheme.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993438#post993438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">5) an (Ugallu tyrant ) Corporate Manager wants to Engineer a Hostile takeover. He has Access to Allies (Media) 2 and (City Hall) 3. What can he do?<br /> Thanks in advance, it is appreciated!</div> </div> </div> </div>Not much familiar with Beast. Get your allies to crack down on the company with shitty articles &amp; policies that fuck it up and then buy it as a bargain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T12:59:56-07:00","id":993653,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12191_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12191\" data-vbnamecard=\"12191\">Malus</a> <br /> <br /> Thanks! I actually had to look up Ponzi Scheme ^^&quot; I have zero criminal creativity, I guess. How would you pull one off, though? Simply start with some sort of business and then pull people in?<br /> <br /> If it's okay to pick your brain some more, here are two more:<br /> <br /> 1. You have to shut down someone's access to the harbor. What Merits might be nice for that? Which ways could go you go about it? Let's assume this case for a) you're a Diplomat and b) a Soldier.<br /> 2. You want to have a single person disappear. That person is crucial to the opposing side's schemes and well protected, splinter cell-ing him or her is out of the question. You need to destroy his power base. How though?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T05:59:09-07:00","id":994002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993653#post993653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks! I actually had to look up Ponzi Scheme ^^&quot; I have zero criminal creativity, I guess. How would you pull one off, though? Simply start with some sort of business and then pull people in?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's several examples, several books written on the issue, which I'm not going to explicitly discuss about, because it's against the terms of use.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993653#post993653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. You have to shut down someone's access to the harbor. What Merits might be nice for that? Which ways could go you go about it? Let's assume this case for a) you're a Diplomat and b) a Soldier.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where's the harbor? Who is the target?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993653#post993653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. You want to have a single person disappear. That person is crucial to the opposing side's schemes and well protected, splinter celling him or her is out of the question. You need to destroy his power base. How though?</div> </div> </div> </div>That doesn't tells me enough about your target one way or another.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T06:34:41-07:00","id":994011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=994002#post994002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's several examples, several books written on the issue, which I'm not going to explicitly discuss about, because it's against the terms of use.<br /> <br /> Where's the harbor? Who is the target?<br /> <br /> That doesn't tells me enough about your target one way or another.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I didn't know that. Sorry!<br /> <br /> Let's go with Boston Harbor, the target is a puppet of the Brood and a local high ranking politician. You want him to be unable to approach the harbor for a month to intercept a delivery. If he is unable to Operate there at all, even better.<br /> <br /> Sorry. Let's say he's a CEO of a pharmazeutical Corporation with a lot of acclaim, with a lot of money and political And police connections to boot. However, he Supports infrastructure some Unchained wants gone, and you got the short end of the Stick and have to Ruin the Project by ruining him. You'd like to avoid much collateral damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T07:02:23-07:00","id":994016,"title":"","content":"Hey, sorry, are you in Boston, or just running you're game here? I moved here in July. Don't know enough players in the area.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T08:04:13-07:00","id":994026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=994016#post994016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, sorry, are you in Boston, or just running you're game here? I moved here in July. Don't know enough players in the area.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, I am from Germany, Boston just came to my mind because it'd probably be easier for people to relate to compared to German cities^^<br /> Sorry about that, but Boston should have a few, being big city and all. Maybe try looking here / opening a request here <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...and-gatherings</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T14:34:10-07:00","id":994227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=994011#post994011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's go with Boston Harbor, the target is a puppet of the Brood and a local high ranking politician. You want him to be unable to approach the harbor for a month to intercept a delivery. If he is unable to Operate there at all, even better.</div> </div> </div> </div>Take someone he cares about hostage, then you can literally have him deliver it to you instead.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=994011#post994011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry. Let's say he's a CEO of a pharmazeutical Corporation with a lot of acclaim, with a lot of money and political And police connections to boot. However, he Supports infrastructure some Unchained wants gone, and you got the short end of the Stick and have to Ruin the Project by ruining him. You'd like to avoid much collateral damage.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's several exploits that could ruin him. Other operations could include getting access to him and Hard Leverage him into signing his soul away, then you'd gain a measure of control over the infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-28T09:46:09-07:00","id":994637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=994227#post994227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Take someone he cares about hostage, then you can literally have him deliver it to you instead.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> There's several exploits that could ruin him. Other operations could include getting access to him and Hard Leverage him into signing his soul away, then you'd gain a measure of control over the infrastructure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay thanks, that (and the RPPR podcast) helped alot already!<br /> <br /> Now, maybe another approach to help me settle something once and for all in my brain:<br /> What would be some of the things I could pull with Status (Mob) 3 I couldn't pull with Status (Mob) 2 or Allies (Mob) 3? Generally, when is Status better than Allies?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-28T10:17:17-07:00","id":994651,"title":"","content":"With Status, you don't have to worry about your connection going bad. If you're Allies with the Mob, those connections could go sour. You have to push to get favours from them, which is where the roll comes in. If you have Status in the Mob, then you have the downside of needing to maintain ties to organized crime, because you are, by necessity of what Status is, a mobster yourself. On the plus side, all those things you'd need to ask of the Allies (Mob)? All the favours you have to pay back, the chances of them not liking your deal? You don't need to worry about that anymore.<br /> <br /> Status in an organization means you can do everything you could with an equal level of Allies, except it's no longer at a remove- you're responsible for it, meaning it happens immediately, but the onus is also on you personally if anything goes wrong. If the Mob favour represented by Allies goes down the tube in a bad way, they'll look at the Allies before you. If you order a hit yourself thanks to Status, that <i>will </i>come back to you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-28T11:12:48-07:00","id":994703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=994651#post994651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With Status, you don't have to worry about your connection going bad. If you're Allies with the Mob, those connections could go sour. You have to push to get favours from them, which is where the roll comes in. If you have Status in the Mob, then you have the downside of needing to maintain ties to organized crime, because you are, by necessity of what Status is, a mobster yourself. On the plus side, all those things you'd need to ask of the Allies (Mob)? All the favours you have to pay back, the chances of them not liking your deal? You don't need to worry about that anymore.<br /> <br /> Status in an organization means you can do everything you could with an equal level of Allies, except it's no longer at a remove- you're responsible for it, meaning it happens immediately, but the onus is also on you personally if anything goes wrong. If the Mob favour represented by Allies goes down the tube in a bad way, they'll look at the Allies before you. If you order a hit yourself thanks to Status, that <i>will </i>come back to you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I think I now finally got that.<br /> <br /> <br /> So, my incentive for opening the thread is satisfied, the itch has been scratched so to speak, but by all means you are always welcome to post additional inspirational material (gonna give black mirror a shot now)<br /> <br /> Btw, how high does House of Cards rank on the scale for social engineering (e.g. lets say leveraged is a 10, and Dragonball Z a 0)? Recently re-started watching it.<br /> Also, is there such a scale? If not, there should be, that might be helpful in the future (also, equivalents: Scale of Battles: GoT 1-2, Dragonball Z 9; Scale of Mindgames: Code Geass 3, The Damned 6-7. Your turn =P).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-07T17:52:17-08:00","id":1000053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993039-social-engineering-or-your-favourite-tales-of-deceit-and-manipulation?p=993438#post993438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4) a guy needs To raise A Lot of money quickly. What can he pull to do so?</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6MwGeOm8iI\" data-code=\"s6MwGeOm8iI\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/s6MwGeOm8iI/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-07T20:19:44-08:00","id":1000109,"title":"","content":"Hey Wormwood,<br /> <br /> If possible I'd recommend taking a look at the supplement Damnation City. It's a Requiem 1st Edition supplement about city building but turned out to be one of the most influential supplements in my arsenal for CofD social intrigue. It really gives you a look at the moving parts of a city and how the supernatural population use it to secure power and status over others of their kind and beyond. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Spellcheck 11-07-2016, 11:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}